      "worked": "Write $123^{456}=10^k$. Taking base-10 logarithms gives\n$$\\begin{align*}k&=\\log_{10}(123^{456})\\\\k&=456\\log_{10}(123)\\\\k&\\approx952.996730816.\\end{align*}$$\nKeeping the calculator value of $k$,\n$$\\begin{align*}123^{456}&=10^{k-952}\\times10^{952}\\\\123^{456}&\\approx9.925\\times10^{952}.\\end{align*}$$\nThe coefficient is correct to four significant figures.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
